(5,'What is a benchmark?','A test that measures performance','A type of cable','A backup tool','A virus scanner',0,'It gives you a score you can compare.'),
(5,'Which component stores data permanently?','RAM','Cache','SSD','Register',2,'Your files are still there after a restart.'),
(5,'Which unit measures CPU clock speed?','GB','Mbps','dB','GHz',3,'Gigacycles per second.'),
(5,'What is the main job of a GPU?','Graphics and parallel processing','Cooling the system','Storing passwords','Connecting to Wi-Fi',0,'Games and video editing rely on it heavily.'),
(5,'Which memory is the fastest?','Hard disk','CPU cache','RAM','SSD',1,'It sits right next to the processor cores.'),
(5,'Which part supplies power to the components?','PSU','GPU','BIOS','NIC',0,'Its name starts with Power.'),
(5,'What does the BIOS do when a computer starts?','Edits documents','Browses the web','Tests hardware and begins booting','Compresses files',2,'It runs before the operating system.'),
